es, un cinéma, des restaurants, une crèche et un groupe scolaire. À quelques minutes des parcs, des équipements culturels et des lignes de transport (métro, tram, RER), Issy Cœur de Ville offre un emplacement privilégié aux portes de Paris.","addr":"Rue du Général Leclerc","gal":["https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182YTIxNWZjZjY3ZTczMC4zMzc2MjcwMyIsImVkaXRzIjp7InJlc2l6ZSI6eyJ3aWR0aCI6OTAwLCJoZWlnaHQiOjkwMCwiZml0IjoiaW5zaWRlIn19LCJmaWxlSGFzaCI6IjU3ODc0ZWY4NzFiYjNkYTNjYjFmYTVlNzZlNjZiNjBhMGFjMTA1MGY3OWE0NTVhMWQxODM2NmIzMDM4YThhNjEifQ==?signature=ed5d5bd17951a1f33f235673eaaf602063fb70a174a778c92d9476be0ce69267","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182YTM5Mzg2ODZlY2FjNC45NjM0Mjg1MCIsImVkaXRzIjp7InJlc2l6ZSI6eyJ3aWR0aCI6OTAwLCJoZWlnaHQiOjkwMCwiZml0IjoiaW5zaWRlIn19LCJmaWxlSGFzaCI6IjExNTcwMWY1MWIyMTIyMTljMGU2MjBkYTA5MThkMmVlY2NhNmU0NWExYzFkZmNmNzU0NjY3MzZiY2NjM2E5MjAifQ==?signature=29a9d09d88d8e1e6d6e6f334a6b7d098ace0e9a3579928b092f98948399bc38e"],"yt":[],"vr":[],"logo":"https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182NmEzYjY1ZjQzNzk5IiwiZWRpdHMiOnsicmVzaXplIjp7IndpZHRoIjo4NSwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo4NSwiZml0IjoiY292ZXIifX0sImZpbGVIYXNoIjoidXBsb2FkaW5nXzY2YTNiNjVmNDM3OTYifQ==?signature=c895b6108988c829083e0ba81169355da19874f63d175e09fbb1758cfafc1e87","zone":"ABis","lots":[{"ty":"Studio alcôve","na":"Appartement","s":35.4,"f":"3","ex":["SE"],"ter":0,"pk":0,"pr":[{"tva":20.0,"p":413606.0}],"opt":false},{"ty":"Studio alcôve","na":"Appartement","s":35.4,"f":"4","ex":["NO"],"ter":0,"pk":0,"pr":[{"tva":20.0,"p":426539.0}],"opt":true},{"ty":"Studio alcôve","na":"Appartement","s":35.8,"f":"5","ex":["NO"],"ter":0,"pk":0,"pr":[{"tva":20.0,"p":443258.0}],"opt":false},{"ty":"T1 alcôve","na":"Appartement","s":35.9,"f":"6","ex":["NO"],"ter":0,"pk":0,"pr":[{"tva":20.0,"p":463265.0}],"opt":false},{"ty"